footer Twice 55 Community Songs 1919
settled Matthias 2026-11-07: A (Twice 55 Community Songs 1919) sings "Three blind mice" (bars 1-4) and "See how they run" (bars 5-8) twice each, as in the round, B (Augener 1917) sings each once, so B has 12 bars to A's 16; and the last note, A D4:6~ D4:4 R:2 (12 sixteenths in total), B D4:6~ D4:4 (10, the print's short last bar); every other note of A's material agrees with B; Zitro plays the 1919 form with the repeats, and a blind second reading of another print (Augener 1917) confirmed A's notes.
